    "rich_text_t3iXwB": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_x3rCGh": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A refined online store showcasing timeless furniture and elegant décor pieces.",
            "heading_size": "h5",
            "enable_text_reveal": false
          }
        },
        "text_VJwRQg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The world of furniture and home goods is rich with extraordinary creations. Today, customers can choose from a wide variety of options — from standard, mass-produced pieces to exclusive designs crafted by skilled artisans. Among these are truly remarkable works of craftsmanship that blend functionality with aesthetic beauty, offering a sense of individuality that mass production simply cannot achieve. Each piece tells its own story — the story of careful design, attention to detail, and the passion of the maker. These unique creations are not only furniture but also expressions of artistry, destined to be appreciated by those who value timeless design and authenticity.</p><p>At Linea, we have curated a collection that reflects this philosophy — selecting only the finest models from contemporary craftsmen who masterfully combine elegance, quality, and practicality in every product. Our assortment includes pieces from trusted manufacturers with whom we’ve built long-standing relationships based on reliability, integrity, and shared values. Each brand we collaborate with guarantees exceptional quality, durability, and design precision. Their furniture stands out not only for its beautiful appearance but also for its comfort, safety, and ability to serve you faithfully for years to come.</p>",
            "large_text": false,
            "show_more_toggle": true,
            "max_height": 8
          }
        }
      },
